    "detailed_description": "<h1>Something New Is Rolling In</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One of our three new cars is ready!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious to find out which one it is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord channel to be the first to know <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450420/extras/19eb6833bf4ef5f15975542391dc4650.avif?t=1752928959\" width=1600 height=956 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make My Car - will take you into the automotive world.\u00a0Starting in a small, old factory, you are given a golden opportunity to become a part of somethin big. Your uncle Bort, a renowned engineer and inventor, starts sending you unique car blueprints that, due to their complexity and abstract nature, are not suitable for large companies. However, for your small company, these blueprints could be the key to success. Sometimes you'll have to finish them.\u00a0Sell cars, expand your factory, hire staff, and develop innovative models to dominate the automotive market.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make My Car - will take you into the automotive world.\u00a0Starting in a small, old factory, you are given a golden opportunity to become a part of somethin big. Your uncle Bort, a renowned engineer and inventor, starts sending you unique car blueprints that, due to their complexity and abstract nature, are not suitable for large companies. However, for your small company, these blueprints could be the key to success. Sometimes you'll have to finish them.\u00a0Sell cars, expand your factory, hire staff, and develop innovative models to dominate the automotive market.</p>",
